voynich-manuscript-metadata: license

Dataset: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

  VCAT's annotations (the section names and their attribution, confidence and
  dispute flags) are CC-BY-4.0. The fields read from the page headers of the
  Zandbergen-Landini (ZL) transliteration are CC0-1.0, as voynich.nu states for
  that transliteration (recorded in data_sources/sources.yaml and
  docs/SOURCES_LICENSE.md of the repository; read at its source on
  2026-10-17).

  Please cite the transliterators and the scholars named in the dataset card's
  References section.

Code that builds the data: MIT License
  https://github.com/noah-chelednik/voynich-data/blob/main/LICENSE

The manuscript itself is in the public domain.
